WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:01.740
Ayado.

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:05.280
You can think it over. Figure out what you really want
before we start doing this.

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.740
I'm sorry!

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.990
I love you, Senpai!

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.200
I know you hid your pain all this time,
so you could be here to support me!

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.740
And I love you!

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.530
I'm sorry for always causing you to make that face.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.610
Please stop holding back
your real feelings because of me!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.490
What a relief.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:30.490
Thank you, Ayado. I feel better now.

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:46.570
Huh? Takanashi?

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:48.240
You on your way home?

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.150
What are you hanging around here for?

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.320
Nothing. It's just, look.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.030
They look happy.

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:58.780
Must be nice, starting a new relationship.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:05.110
Takanashi, you want a girlfriend... Want a girlfriend...

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:05.110
I do not.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:06.610
It's what normal people want!

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:08.610
It's normal for you, Ishino.

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:13.030
Right now, I'm happy just having a few sexy girls
I can hook up with from time to time.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:14.610
What a creep.

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:18.200
I'm not interested in having a girlfriend
just for the sake of having a girlfriend.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:22.780
Don't most people fall in love and then decide
they'd like to be in a relationship?

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.650
That sounds like your roundabout way
of turning me down.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:30.950
Uh, I straight-up reject you all the time.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:34.110
You and I both know
you're not really that serious about it.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.900
No, I would be overjoyed if you agreed to date me.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:41.030
Come on, who goes to a ramen place with her crush
and asks for a second helping of rice?

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.240
I was hungry that day, okay?

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:44.860
But you didn't need seconds.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:46.490
You might as well be my guy friend.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.530
Now you've really made me mad!

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:56.990
What is this?

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:58.650
Shouldn't it be the other way around?

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:05.110
How can I get you to like me?

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:27.700
Crying in a place like this,

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:33.700
No one will notice me. I know that

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:37.400
As if nothing ever happened,

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:43.110
The world alone moves forward, erasing the past

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:47.950
Even though I decided to photograph you on that film

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:52.450
The bottomless sky keeps accumulating

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.490
We may forget, but it doesn't disappear

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:57.200
That pain, remember? What was it?

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:02.900
If we get lost in the changing scenery,

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:07.030
We could try remembering that song

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:12.570
Yes, if we're together, even the sad things

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:16.360
Should eventually become treasures

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:25.490
I want to show you that you blended into the background

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:30.860
But didn't fade away that day

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:44.530
Episode 18
Regarding the Courtship
of My Female Friend Ishino.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.950
Wait a minute. I think you might have just
tugged at my heartstrings a little.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:47.900
Really?

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:48.900
Yeah.

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:50.490
There, just keep doing that.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.150
Like this? You like this?

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:57.200
This contrast with your usual self kinda gets me.
Like, that pained expression.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.200
I see, that makes sense!

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.700
You are just making fun of me, aren't you?!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:03.360
Never mind!

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:07.030
What? Is this what I think it is, Ayado?
You have a boyfriend?

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:08.950
Um...

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:10.700
That's so funny!

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:14.700
Th-these are my classmates, Tajima and Yamano.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:15.740
And...

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.740
This... this is...

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:23.240
The boy I started dating last week, Ito-senpai.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:33.150
We weren't asking for an introduction!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:37.360
Wow, Ayado, so you do care about people
in the real world.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.320
You're always holed up in the classroom
reading manga, so I thought...

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.820
I think it's great!

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:45.990
You make a good couple! I'm happy for you, Ayado!

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:52.860
What's so funny, huh? Don't make fun of them!

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:54.150
Ishino-senpai!
Ishino!

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:56.320
She's
meddling
again...

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:56.320
She's meddling again.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:05:00.820
They're doing the best they can with their lives,
so you worry about your own, okay?

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.610
That hurts! That hurts!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:06.450
Don't laugh at other people
when you don't know anything about them, stupid!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.900
I..Ishino-senpai!

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.570
Wh-what is your problem?

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.780
Who are you, and how dare you talk down to me, hag?!

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.150
What?! "Hag"?! You wanna fight me, dammit?!

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.860
You little...

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:19.360
Believe it or not, I'm a huge fan of Jackie Chan!

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.110
T..Takanashi-senpai?

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:24.400
Takanashi.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:26.650
Girls shouldn't fight!

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.240
And don't use filthy language!

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:30.280
This is why I'm not interested in you, Ishino!

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:31.610
And you.

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:35.320
The start of a relationship is an important time,
so give them their space.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.400
Uh, o-okay...

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.360
Let's go.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:43.200
Thank you so much!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.740
Takanashi...

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:48.030
Seriously.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:50.780
You can't just mind your own business, can you?

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.740
What did you expect?

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.450
I'm just a girl with nothing better to do,
who boys will never like.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.990
I never said any of that.

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:02.950
I wouldn't mind making an exception
and taking you on a date today.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:03.650
Huh?

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:05.450
To a ramen place.

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:06.450
Again?

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:08.280
Are you interested or not?

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.280
I'm interested.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:13.400
RAMEN
NUMBER ONE

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:13.400
Here's your ramen! Thanks for waiting!

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:16.780
Excuse me! Could I get some rice on the side?

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:18.530
You're still doing that?

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:22.200
What do you want from me?
This is my hungriest time of day!

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.900
Well, you do seem to use way more energy
than anyone ever needs to.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:29.950
I think you could stand to use
a little more energy, Takanashi.

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:32.700
I don't have anything worth using energy on.

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:38.450
You're
so
boring!!

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:38.360
You are so stuck up! Haven't you ever,
I don't know, felt really passionate about something?

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:40.610
I have.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:42.280
It was back in middle school...

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:44.360
But it did happen.

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:48.450
What were you passionate about?

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:49.990
I'm not telling.

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:52.780
What?! You can't just leave me hanging! Now I'm curious!

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:56.860
This isn't a date, anyway.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.700
What, you have a problem?

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:00.280
Yes, I have a problem!

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:01.900
It's always ramen.

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:05.400
You wanna try it, then?

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.570
Going on a real date.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.240
Huh? Really?

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:13.110
It was your idea! Try to be excited!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.900
My mom wants to know if you want to
come over for dinner again sometime.

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:23.990
Huh?

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.240
And she told me to ask you what you like.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:27.070
Really?

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:27.900
Yeah.

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.700
What would I like...?

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:31.150
I'd like to have hotpot again.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.030
You like hotpot?

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.650
Well, it's more like...

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:38.320
It was a lot of fun, all eating out of the same pot last time.

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.900
Yeah, I guess it was.

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:44.990
By the way, in our family, oden isn't hotpot.
We put it in the "simmered food" category.

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.450
Uh, oh, okay.

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:50.200
And when we have crab cream croquettes,
the rule is we have to call Mom a god.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:51.450
Why?

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.650
Apparently because the cooking process
is "more damn trouble than it's worth."

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:58.150
Well, I'll see you Monday.

00:07:58.150 --> 00:07:58.950
Yeah.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.400
The seasons are... changing.

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:19.530
I'm home.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:24.450
Wh-what are you doing?

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:25.780
What?

00:08:25.780 --> 00:08:28.700
I asked what are you doing?!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:29.900
What?

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:37.030
Excuse me, I am making an apron for Iroha.
Don't interrupt me!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:39.200
What? Uh, why...?

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.860
So? Did you get Iroha's request for dinner?

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.860
When is she coming again?

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:46.450
Uh, yeah. She says she wants hotpot.

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:47.860
Hotpot. Got it.

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.990
And we haven't decided when she's coming again.

00:08:49.990 --> 00:08:51.450
Oh, no, really?

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.570
How about your next three-day weekend?
I'm sure you don't have plans.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:00.820
Big Brother.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.900
Can you knock?

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.820
Lend me your marine encyclopedia.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:05.900
What?!

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.320
I'm taking Anzu to the aquarium.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:11.610
It's heavy...

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:16.150
Don't you have a smaller one?
Something more easily portable.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.280
No.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.990
Is that how you treat your older brother?!

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:23.360
I don't know what Iroha ever saw in you.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.450
And suddenly you're insulting me.

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:26.900
It's not sudden.

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:30.450
Such a beautiful, decent girl is actually your girlfriend.

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:31.400
And not only that...

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.570
There is no one cooler than your brother.

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.240
She even thinks highly of you.

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:40.200
That just can't be right.

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.530
I thought the same thing.

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.490
But...

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:49.400
It's hard to explain. I don't really care...
what she thinks of me.

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:52.530
I just...

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:55.280
I just want to make her happy.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:58.950
Kaoru?

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:02.700
I'm taking notes. Tell me what you've done with her,
and give me specifics.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.240
How much have you spent on her?
In what ways have you sacrificed for her?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:09.490
Why you little-?! Why should I have to go through that?

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.530
I'm on a date!

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:15.450
And it's like a real, actual date!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:24.110
It's huge! Look at the big fish, Takanashi!

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:26.150
It's not as big as your voice, Ishino.

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.450
Well, I haven't been to an aquarium in forever!

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.150
I mean,
it's a real
date-like
date!!

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:33.900
Ooh, look, this one's a moray! Gross! Isn't it gross?

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.610
Are you going to be like this all day?

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:37.740
Let's go over there next!

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.360
Whoa, wait a minute.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.570
We're holding hands?

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:42.780
Of course we are! We're on a date!

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:44.990
Sorry, I'm not sure I can...

00:10:45.280 --> 00:10:46.740
It just feels a little weird.

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:49.610
Oh, come on, it's just your hand!
Why won't you share, meanie?

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:51.860
Anyway, Ishino, are you hungry-

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:54.570
I don't think my foot is supposed to bend that way!

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:55.200
Huh?!

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.570
Owww!

00:10:56.700 --> 00:11:00.110
Ugh, this is what you get for wearing heels
when you don't know how to walk in them.

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:01.860
And you're too excited.

00:11:04.070 --> 00:11:05.900
Huh? Is something wrong?

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.780
I'm fine! You wanted to eat, right? Let's go.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:13.110
Hey, slow down, Ishino.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.240
Okay, Anzu.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.700
What do you want to see?

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:17.700
The sunfish!

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.610
A-Anzu?!

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:24.200
B-Big Brother!

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:30.950
Anzu!

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:34.900
You told me you would be playing
with your friend Kirara today!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:36.820
This does NOT look like Kirara!

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:39.400
In fact, it looks like Tsutsui's brother!

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.280
Kaoru... run!

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:51.450
I am Kaoru Tsutsui, and I am dating Anzu.

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:54.360
"D-dating"?

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:57.030
You're dating Tsutsui's brother?

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:58.110
You've gotta be kidding!

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.320
My older brother has nothing to do with this.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:05.570
Yes, he does! You're related to him!
You look just like him!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:07.360
I never want to hear those words again!

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:08.360
Big Brother!

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:10.070
I'm sorry I lied to you!

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:13.400
But I love him! I love Kaoru!

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:17.150
I won't stand for this!

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:19.700
You're still in grade school! We're going home, Anzu!

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.280
What? N-no!

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:24.860
I'm finally on a date with Kaoru!

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:26.320
I don't want to go home!

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:28.570
Hey, wait a minute!

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:31.900
Sorry about this, Ishino. I'll make it up to you sometime.

00:12:31.900 --> 00:12:34.280
No, it's not about the date.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:38.320
You need to calm down.
You can't drag her off like that! I feel bad for her!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:42.450
I know you're her brother.
But that's no reason to tear them apart like this.

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:45.360
It's none of your business, Ishino.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:51.070
Stop butting into people's family affairs.
You really do like to meddle.

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:57.900
L-let's get out of here, Kaoru!

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:11.150
Sorry, let's call it a day. I'll take you home.

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:13.740
Forget it. I can get myself home.

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:18.900
Excuse me for always sticking my nose
where it doesn't belong.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.400
I'm sorry, too! For being such a meddler!

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:33.740
Why are you following me?

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:35.740
Uh, we live in the same area.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:36.400
And...

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:39.320
I want to make you feel better.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.950
I really am sorry about today.

00:13:58.740 --> 00:13:59.900
Ow!

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:01.570
What was that fo-?!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.030
Don't treat me like an idiot!

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:05.240
I mean, I know I am an idiot.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.700
But...

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:12.400
Ugh.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:17.860
I actually looked forward to today. I even curled my hair.

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.570
I really am an idiot!

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:22.820
I'm sorry.

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.360
Hello?

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:28.860
What?

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.950
What?! Really?!

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:32.740
Okay. Yeah. Yeah!

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:33.490
What?

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:38.610
Anzu texted Mom. She said she was
running off with her boyfriend.

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:39.280
Huh?!

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:44.240
S-so what are we doing here? We have to go find them!

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:46.570
What? That's okay, Ishino.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:47.860
You don't have to help.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:48.650
I mean...

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:50.490
I'm sorry for meddling, okay!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.740
But this is no time to be polite!

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.570
She's your sister, isn't she?!

00:14:56.280 --> 00:14:57.150
Yeah.

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:00.490
I'm sorry! Please help me, Ishino!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:21.200
Any ideas? Where else would she go?

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:23.110
I don't know.

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:26.030
We have to find her before it gets dark!

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:28.650
I guess...

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.990
I was too hard on Anzu.

00:15:33.860 --> 00:15:34.650
Yeah.

00:15:36.110 --> 00:15:38.240
Do you think I hurt her?

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.400
Yeah... probably.

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:43.150
It's just, we don't have a dad at home.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.200
So I tend to get pretty strict with her.

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:51.700
I see.

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:55.110
Takanashi!

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:58.240
Maybe they're still in the next town.

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.820
It's possible they never came back from the aquarium!

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:07.490
1,250 yen.

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:10.110
I think we can get by for about three days, maybe.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:12.240
D-do you think we'll be okay?

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.860
Yeah, if we spend the night here.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.860
But are you sure?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:21.320
If I go home, then I don't think
they'll ever let me see you again.

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:25.570
I'm a little nervous, but you're here, so I know I'll be okay.

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:35.150
You haven't gotten any calls from your mom or dad?

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:36.570
I turned off my phone.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:40.570
But I guess I might have a lot of calls
from my mom and my brother.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:41.780
Oh.

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:46.150
My family... doesn't have a dad.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.530
So my brother sometimes gets a little overprotective.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.530
He's usually very nice, but...

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:55.700
Sorry about him!

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.610
I just...

00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.610
I just want to make her happy.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:06.360
Actually, let's go home.

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:08.570
Come on, Anzu.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:10.530
Huh?

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.900
B..but why-

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:26.820
I think it's wrong to do anything
that would make your mother and brother sad.

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:31.070
Don't worry.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:34.900
I promise, I'll prove to your family that they can trust me.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.450
I'll keep talking to them until I convince them.

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:40.990
K-Kaoru...

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:43.030
I love you!

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:52.740
Ow! My own parents never hit me!

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:54.570
And why shouldn't I hit you?!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:57.280
A couple of grade schoolers,
running off together! Are you stupid?

00:17:57.280 --> 00:18:00.030
Only because you grownups keep trying
to force us to do everything your way!

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:02.820
What's wrong with grade schoolers dating each other?

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:05.320
What's wrong with me being Hikari's brother?

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:07.200
Give me a logical explanation!

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.150
What?!

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:09.490
Anzu!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:20.150
It was my fault. I'm the one who kept her out this late.

00:18:22.110 --> 00:18:24.070
No, it's not, Big Brother.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:27.740
Kaoru was saying we should go home.

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:38.860
Okay, I get it. I was wrong, too.

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.030
I'm ready to hear your side of things.

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:44.740
So come on by and visit sometime.

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:46.820
Okay.

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:49.530
Seriously...

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:52.150
You really are just like Tsutsui.

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:54.150
Me? Like him?

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.820
Anyway, I'm glad we found them!

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:01.320
Ishino, your feet...

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.030
I noticed something was hurting...

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:12.400
All because you were running around,
helping me search.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:14.950
I'm sorry. I should have noticed.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:18.900
I don't mind. It's not like you forced me to do it.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.280
Don't worry about it.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.700
Thank you, Ishino.

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:35.320
Sorry I had to borrow your shoes.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.700
It's fine.

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:51.990
That reminds me, I was mad at you!

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:55.820
Besides, my hair and makeup are a mess.

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.110
I'm drenched in sweat.

00:19:57.110 --> 00:20:00.320
To be honest, I'm really embarrassed,
so you can go on home now.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:01.650
Will you be okay?

00:20:01.650 --> 00:20:02.780
I'll be fine.

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:03.900
Goodbye.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:13.450
Ishino! Let's go on another date!

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:16.610
This time, I'll ask you out!

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.700
If you insist!

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:35.030
Hikari! Bam!

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:38.400
You could at least knock, Mom!

00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:40.150
Here! This is for you!

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:42.240
What is this thing?

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:47.030
I had extra fabric from Iroha's apron.
So I made you a cell phone cover!

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:48.570
A cell phone cover?!

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.110
To match Iroha's.

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:54.400
And your father and I will be
going on a date this next three-day weekend.

00:20:55.490 --> 00:20:58.570
So we'll have to have Iroha
over for dinner some other time, 'kay?

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:03.530
I'm really not sure about this...

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:09.490
What are you doing on our next day off?

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:09.320
What are you doing on our next day off?

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:12.860
Our next day off, huh...?

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:20.780
The rhythm of the dry leaves, the season of endings,

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:24.860
You led me by the hand

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:36.280
The white breath is the fading future (future)

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:54.320
Whether again or for the first time, show me your childlike face

00:21:55.490 --> 00:22:00.740
Could you meet the person you wanted to meet?

00:22:00.740 --> 00:22:05.990
Could you be the person you wanted to be?

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:16.650
By being yourself, you helped me to be myself

00:22:16.780 --> 00:22:22.030
This day, today, when all we do is breathe,

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:27.280
Is more wonderful than anything

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:32.610
I don't need anything. Now let's go

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:40.740
There's nothing to worry about
